SJc8AAAABCjg0cQ","user":{"login":"dsarno","id":2432103,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzIxMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2432103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno","html_url":"https://github.com/dsarno","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-16T09:10:16Z","updated_at":"2026-05-16T09:13:14Z","body":"> Did you use an LLM when creating this PR?\n\nYes I did. Happy to answer any questions about that. The whole process, including the minimal repro -- which was the most painstaking part because it kept wanting to say \"this is good enough!\" when it wasn't -- took about 5 hours and much back and forth. \n\nI'm building an mcp for godot, and every time I find a crashing bug in the engine, I'm trying to root cause it as best I can and submit a fix. This is my third. \n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4466422897/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":2,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4466445154","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119505#issuecomment-4466445154","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119505","id":4466445154,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCjiLYg","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-16T09:21:54Z","updated_at":"2026-05-16T09:21:54Z","body":"In that case please be aware that you are required to disclose LLM assistance as per our [Contribution guidelines](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#ai-assisted-contributions). Please also take a look at our [Checklist for new contributors](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors).\r\n\r\nMore specifically, please write your PR descriptions by hand. LLMs are bad at writing helpful PR descriptions.\r\n\r\n<!-- If you want to participate in the dedicated review process for LLM assisted contributions, you need to specifically request it in your response. -->","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4466445154/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-