","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119505","id":4466479504,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCjkRkA","user":{"login":"dsarno","id":2432103,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzIxMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2432103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno","html_url":"https://github.com/dsarno","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-16T09:37:04Z","updated_at":"2026-05-16T09:39:15Z","body":"Just to clarify -- do you think this PR is poorly written? I worked with the LLM to iterate the solution and description until I thought it was clear, minimal and easy to follow.  I don't just sic it on stuff and dump the results willy-nilly, as I know happens often and everywhere these days, including on this project. \n\nHappy to disclose AI help. That was why I mentioned my mcp project, but I can be more explicit going forward. ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4466479504/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4466486453","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119505#issuecomment-44