https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-16T09:55:08Z","updated_at":"2026-05-16T09:55:08Z","body":"By the description it sounds like the code was entirely written by an LLM, is that correct?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4466517958/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4466563133","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119505#issuecomment-4466563133","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119505","id":4466563133,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCjpYPQ","user":{"login":"dsarno","id":2432103,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzIxMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2432103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno","html_url":"https://github.com/dsarno","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-16T10:18:24Z","updated_at":"2026-05-16T10:18:24Z","body":"Yes and no, it's a bit philosophical. It wrote the actual lines of code, yes. But that was the result of a half day process that included me discovering the crash, pushing the LLMs to investigate different hypotheses about it, then iterating many times to get the minimal repro (again, it kept wanting to submit a bigger repro that was not minimal enough for me to understand the root cause). Then when the root was clear I made (had it make if you prefer)  multiple builds testing increasingly minimal solutions, both live tests and via the harnesses. I then ran multiple rounds of code reviews by different LLMs, and worked with them to craft the issue and PR until they read well and clearly to me.\n\nSo the short answer is yes it wrote the code. The longer (imho more meaningful) answer is that I drove the process, problem solving and QA. And I understand the code, the bug and the solution. \n\nIs that a workable approach? I'm trying to be a useful and friendly contributor. Not here to ruffle feathers!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4466563133/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":2,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4466568283","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119505#issuecomment-4466568283","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119505","id":4466568283,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCjpsWw","user